    skos:prefLabel 'Remote Ocean Systems Inc.'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A US based manufacturer and designer of underwater video cameras, underwater lights, rugged pan and tilt units, and video inspection systems for oceanographic, military, and nuclear purposes. Founded in 1975.'@en ;
