    skos:prefLabel 'Panasonic Holdings Corporation'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A Japanese company founded as Matsushita Electric Industrial Co., Ltd. in 1935, and incorporated as Panasonic in 2008. Panasonic is headquartered in Kadoma, Osaka - Japan and designs and manufactures a wide range of products from batteries to consumer products, to automotive and avionic systems.'@en ;
